        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            The Kettlebell Test
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            Available solo, partnered or relay-style.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants carry a kettlebell in each hand while moving back and forth
            between shuttle markers in pace with the bleeps.
            At each marker, kettlebell swings are performed before continuing to the next level.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of mental focus and physical endurance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            Throw
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            Available solo, partnered or relay-style.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants perform shuttle runs between markers while throwing a weighted ball
            over a set height positioned at the midpoint of the course.
            As the time between bleeps shorten, maintaining power, coordination,
            and consistency is key.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of endurance, explosive movement, and control under pressure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
