            Biceps + Lunges
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            Available solo, partnered or relay-style.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants move via walking lunges while performing controlled bicep curls
            throughout each repetition.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            A test of muscular endurance, coordination, balance, and movement quality.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-futura font-bold text-lg text-fuchsia-600 mb-2">
            Slay the Sled
          </h3>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
            Available solo or relay-style.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3">
            Participants push a weighted sled between shuttle markers while keeping pace
            with the bleeps.
          </p>

          <p class="font-futura text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mt-3 italic">
            Each level increases the intensity and tests lower-body power and aerobic endurance.
          </p>
        </div>

